"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6.2\n\n### System information\n\nWin10, NVidia\n\n### Issue description\n\nUnlocking a node does not reveal the 3D Gizmo in the editor.\nAfter unlocking, the gizmo should reappear.\n\n<img width=\"801\" height=\"245\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/478a511d-672a-44ab-9624-2ad4518699a6\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1) Select a Node, lock it.\n2) Select another node, then reselect the locked node.\n3) The 3D gizmo should now not appear.\n4) Unlock the node.\n5) The 3D gizmo does not appear, it _should_.... as it's unlocked now.\n6) It **will** appear when selecting another node, the selecting the node again. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNone.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119147/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119147/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"complete